# Khaaaaaaaaaaaannn! {X}{R}: "deals twice X damage to target creature" (CR 107.3a). X is 1, so a 3/3 is dealt exactly 2
# damage and not 1: `.Damage = 2` fails for a card that deals X. Its target must be a creature, so a player is refused;
# Bot1's own creature is a legal target (there is no "an opponent controls"). The second Khaaaaaaaaaaaannn! is drawn on
# turn 3, when the Moxen are untapped again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Centaur Courser
Khaaaaaaaaaaaannn!
Mox Sapphire
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

